{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32699","headline":"镜湖夜泊有怀 · 李频","name":"镜湖夜泊有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广水遥堤利物功，因思太守惠无穷。\n自从版筑兴农隙，长与耕耘致岁丰。\n涨接星津流荡漾，宽浮云岫动虚空。\n想当战国开时有，范蠡扁舟祗此中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}